msgid "GB24_Centurion_Mk3_HW_BOT_descr"
msgstr ""
"A medium tank with mediocre mobility, reliable frontal armor, and an "
"excellent gun."

msgid "GB24_Centurion_Mk3_HW_BOT_short"
msgstr "Corrupted"

msgid "GB24_Centurion_Mk3_Halloween_event"
msgstr "Cerberus"

msgid "GB24_Centurion_Mk3_Halloween_event_descr"
msgstr ""
"With the British Centurion Mk.3 serving as its base, the development of the "
"Cerberus was driven by the need for a versatile medium tank capable of "
"operating in hostile environmental conditions. The resulting combination of "
"excellent armor, powerful weaponry, and Mirium-based enhancements proved so "
"effective that Cerberus tanks became all but mandatory for operations "
"conducted within the anomaly."

msgid "GB24_Centurion_Mk3_Halloween_event_long_special"
msgstr ""
"A medium tank with mediocre mobility, reliable frontal armor, and an "
"excellent gun."

